<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Facture</title>
    <style>
        /* Global Styles */
        body {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            margin: 40px;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            color: #333;
        }
        
        /* Header */
        .invoice-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        
        .invoice-header h1 {
            font-size: 36px;
            color: #4CAF50; /* Modern Green */
        }
        
        .invoice-header img {
            max-width: 150px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        /* Table Styles */
        .invoice-details {
            margin-top: 20px;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            width: 100%;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        
        .invoice-details td, .invoice-details th {
            padding: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .invoice-details th {
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .invoice-details td {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }

        .invoice-details tr:nth-child(even) td {
            background-color: #f1f1f1;
        }

        /* Total Price */
        .total {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #4CAF50;
            text-align: right;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #777;
        }

        /* Responsive Design */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .invoice-details th, .invoice-details td {
                padding: 8px;
            }
            .total {
                font-size: 16px;
                text-align: center;
                margin-top: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="invoice-header">
        <h1>Facture</h1>
    </div>

    <h2>Détails de la commande</h2>
    <table class="invoice-details">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Informations</th>
                <th>Détails</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Commande n° :</strong></td>
                <td>{{ commande.id }}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>État :</strong></td>
                <td>{{ commande.etat.value }}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Date de commande :</strong></td>
                <td>{{ commande.dateCommande|date('d/m/Y') }}</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <p class="total">Total: <strong>{{ commande.total }} DT</strong></p>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>Merci pour votre achat ! Vous recevrez votre commande dans 1 à 2 jours.</p>
        <p>Cordialement, <strong>Freeshop</strong>, Responsable des ventes.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>